  divergence from the 2026-08-31 run on identical data: the keyword pass agrees exactly on
  every tab (Football 21, Slots 17, Casino 4, General 2, Baccarat 1, Lottery 0, Playing card
  0 = 45). The 73 inferred rows are distributed differently (that run read Casino 37 /
  Slots 16 / Football 11; this one reads Casino 31 / Football 19 / Slots 11). §4.4 is an
  explicit judgement step, so two passes over the same prose can differ. Each assignment
