  signal tags: Deposit & Withdrawal 10, Promotions 0, Marketing & Acquisition 18, Affiliate & Agent 2, Vague-Evasion Terms 0, Abbreviations 49, Hashtags 0.
    The three zeros are real, not a matching failure: no keyword from those tabs occurs
