clustering (§5): 66 clusters over the 118 gambling URLs; 23 multi-URL, 43 singletons;
  clustersToHalf=15, top5=24.6%, top10=39.8%. Seed linkage (§5.2.1) dominates:
  the crawler asserts a redirect seed for 48 of the 118 rows. Near-miss merges: 0 fired —
  the closest candidates (ufa/ufabet, JW 0.883) sit below the 0.90 floor, and the spec
  forbids merging below it. "Differ only in trailing characters" was made testable as a
  shared leading stem of >= 4 characters alongside JW >= 0.90; both thresholds are stated
  on the methodology card. Rule 4 names each cluster by its shortest *member* stem, so a
  seed-linked cluster is named for its members, not for the redirect entry point.
  topCluster=moenas (7 URLs, seed-linked). Cross-subcategory clusters: 2
  (ufabet: Football Betting 6, General Gambling 1; ufa: Casino 2, Football Betting 1).
  TLD rotation: 14 clusters.
  §5.3 linkage: 7 pairs met Jaccard >= 0.60; 6 shared only BET, the
  abbreviation flagged above as a probable false-positive source, and are withheld with the
  count stated in the card rather than presented as leads. 1 pair reported (ufa/ufagool).
  Nothing was merged on this signal.

